/A 751 0 R
/Alt (Flexible-shaft experimental fixture with two flywheels connected by a long, slender shaft that acts as a torsional spring. Precision roller bearings support the flywheels and minimize friction. A brushed DC motor with an integrated tachometer is mounted on a linear slide; when extended, it engages and drives the proximal flywheel. A second tachometer measures the rotation of the distal flywheel.  )
