/Alt (Experimental setup consisting of the flexible shaft fixture, DC amplifier, wave form generator, digital oscilloscope, and data acquisition unit. The flexible shaft fixture is powered by the amplifier which in turn is controlled by the wave form generator. Input voltage and distal tachometer voltage are measured directly by the oscilloscope. All voltages are measured indirectly in LabVIEW through the data acquisition unit.)
