/A 784 0 R
/Alt (Labelled isometric drawing of the experimental fixture. The fixture is blown up into four separate pieces. The left most piece consists of the motor, motor coupler, and sliding motor mount. The second from the left section consists of the second half of the motor coupler, the left flywheel, flywheel mounts, and the left shaft coupler. The second from the right section consists only of the flexible shaft. The rightmost section consists of the right shaft coupler, flywheel, flywheel mounts, distal tach coupler, and distal tachometer. Each part is labelled and corresponds to an item in Table 1-1. )
