/A 860 0 R
/Alt (Frequency Response tab of the Flex Shaft Main LabVIEW program. The tab consists of four windows that encompass most of the page, program controls in the top right, and two tabs of editable fields in the middle right. In the top left, voltage, current, distal tach voltage, and motor tach voltage are plotted versus time. In the bottom left, current is plotted versus frequency. In The top right, Bode Magnitude is shown, where Db is plotted versus frequency. In the bottom right, Bode Phase is shown, where degrees is plotted versus frequency. Plot windows that have multiple inputs have controls located above each respective plot to toggle individual plot lines on or off.)
