/A 1009 0 R
/Alt (The Frequency Sweep tab located to the right of the plot windows in the Frequency Response tab. There are four editable fields that change frequency sweep parameters; from top to bottom they are Delay in milliseconds, Repetitions, Start frequency in hertz, End frequency in hertz, and frequency Step in hertz. )
/K [12]
/P 1007 0 R
/Pg 29 0 R
/S /Figure
/Type /StructElem
>>
