638 0 obj
<<
/A 1010 0 R
/Alt (The Random Noise tab located to the right of the plot windows in the Frequency Response tab. At the top of the tab is an editable field to set the Duration in seconds, and below this are three editable fields that change Bandpass Filter settings; from top to bottom they are Lower Cutoff frequency in hertz, Upper Cutoff frequency in hertz, and Delta Frequency in hertz. At the bottom of the tab is a toggle button to change the Mode between White Noise and Sigma Sinusoids. )
/K [13]
/P 1008 0 R
/Pg 29 0 R
/S /Figure
/Type /StructElem
>>
